  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "For an array AAA and a number XXX, let's define f(A,X)f(A, X)f(A,X) as follows:\n\n\nIf it is **not possible** to split AAA into several consecutive subarrays in such a way, that the XOR of all elements in each subarray is **not equal to XXX**, f(A,X)=0f(A, X) = 0f(A,X)=0.\nOtherwise, f(A,X)f(A, X)f(A,X) is equal to the **largest** possible number of subarrays in such a split.\nYou are given integers N,K,N, K,N,K, and X,X,X, where 0≤X&lt;2K0 \\leq X \\lt 2^K0≤X&lt;2K. Consider array AAA of length NNN, where each element is an integer generated uniformly from 000 to 2K−12^K - 12K−1. Find the expected value of f(A,X)f(A, X)f(A,X).\n\nIt can be shown that this value can be expressed as PQ\\frac{P}{Q}QP​, where P,QP, QP,Q are non-negative integers and QQQ is not divisible by 998244353998244353998244353. Output PQ−1 mod 998244353PQ^{-1} \\bmod 998244353PQ−1mod998244353 (such unique value 0≤R&lt;9982443530 \\le R &lt; 9982443530≤R&lt;998244353 that RQ≡P mod 998244353RQ \\equiv P \\bmod 998244353RQ≡Pmod998244353).\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe only line of the input contains 333 integers N,K,N, K,N,K, and XXX.\n\n\nOutput Format\nOutput the expected value of f(A,X)f(A, X)f(A,X) modulo 998244353998244353998244353.\n\nIt can be shown that this value can be expressed as PQ\\frac{P}{Q}QP​, where P,QP, QP,Q are non-negative integers and QQQ is not divisible by 998244353998244353998244353. Output PQ−1 mod 998244353PQ^{-1} \\bmod 998244353PQ−1mod998244353 (such unique value 0≤R&lt;9982443530 \\le R &lt; 9982443530≤R&lt;998244353 that RQ≡P mod 998244353RQ \\equiv P \\bmod 998244353RQ≡Pmod998244353).",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N≤1061 \\leq N \\leq 10^61≤N≤106",
      "1≤K≤601 \\leq K \\leq 601≤K≤60",
      "0≤X&lt;2K0 \\leq X \\lt 2^K0≤X&lt;2K.",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 111 (5 points):** X=0X = 0X=0",
      "**Subtask 222 (10 points):** N≤20N \\leq 20N≤20, K≤4K \\leq 4K≤4.",
      "**Subtask 333 (15 points):** N≤100,K≤60N \\leq 100, K \\leq 60N≤100,K≤60.",
      "**Subtask 444 (20 points):** N≤2000,K≤60N \\leq 2000, K \\leq 60N≤2000,K≤60.",
      "**Subtask 555 (50 points):** Original constraints"
    ],
